    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Greed's Grub </strong>is a first-person <strong>horror game</strong> where you must<strong> craft burgers for nightmarish and goofy customers in a hellish diner,</strong> facing terrifying challenges<strong> for five days</strong> in order to survive.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don\u2019t remember exactly what you did, just that it had to have been <strong>real bad</strong>, if this was your punishment. <strong>Five days of community service</strong> in this <strong>greasy</strong>, <strong>rotting</strong> excuse for a <strong>burger joint</strong>. Just five days, and you\u2019re free. That\u2019s all you have to endure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Outlast Your Horrific Customers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serve up burgers to the most weirdest and nastiest customers from the depths of hell. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655930/extras/fcd22e9463053d673872131ee94b940f.poster.avif?t=1750726559\" width=592 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655930/extras/fcd22e9463053d673872131ee94b940f.webm?t=1750726559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655930/extras/fcd22e9463053d673872131ee94b940f.mp4?t=1750726559\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cook, Cook, Cook.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grill, assemble, and pray for five days straight at a cursed burger joint. Each day is more intense than the last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655930/extras/d605a66d06a451aa68a5d7c6475f7c0c.poster.avif?t=1750726559\" width=800 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655930/extras/d605a66d06a451aa68a5d7c6475f7c0c.webm?t=1750726559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655930/extras/d605a66d06a451aa68a5d7c6475f7c0c.mp4?t=1750726559\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Beware the Boss from Hell</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The boss is watching, and failure isn\u2019t an option. Keep your grill hot and your wits sharper, or face the consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655930/extras/76e781c4118efb0b3295bdaffd3c2644.poster.avif?t=1750726559\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655930/extras/76e781c4118efb0b3295bdaffd3c2644.webm?t=1750726559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655930/extras/76e781c4118efb0b3295bdaffd3c2644.mp4?t=1750726559\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an ongoing solo-developed project, created in just 3\u20134ish months of  work. It\u2019s still evolving, and player feedback is greatly appreciated as development continues. Expect regular updates, new features, and improvements based on community input. Your support and suggestions help shape the future of the game.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Greed's Grub </strong>is a first-person <strong>horror game</strong> where you must<strong> craft burgers for nightmarish and goofy customers in a hellish diner,</strong> facing terrifying challenges<strong> for five days</strong> in order to survive.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don\u2019t remember exactly what you did, just that it had to have been <strong>real bad</strong>, if this was your punishment. <strong>Five days of community service</strong> in this <strong>greasy</strong>, <strong>rotting</strong> excuse for a <strong>burger joint</strong>. Just five days, and you\u2019re free. That\u2019s all you have to endure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Outlast Your Horrific Customers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serve up burgers to the most weirdest and nastiest customers from the depths of hell. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655930/extras/fcd22e9463053d673872131ee94b940f.poster.avif?t=1750726559\" width=592 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655930/extras/fcd22e9463053d673872131ee94b940f.webm?t=1750726559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655930/extras/fcd22e9463053d673872131ee94b940f.mp4?t=1750726559\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cook, Cook, Cook.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grill, assemble, and pray for five days straight at a cursed burger joint. Each day is more intense than the last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655930/extras/d605a66d06a451aa68a5d7c6475f